## 11. Demo video — 3 minutes, script it before shooting

| Time | Content |
|---|---|
| 0:00–0:20 | The pain, in accountant language. AP clerks manually matching PO/GRN/invoice; duplicates get paid twice. |
| 0:20–0:50 | Clean invoice ingested, matched, auto-posted. No human touch. |
| 0:50–2:20 | **The exception.** Duplicate detected → escalation packet → review screen → clerk approves rejection → ledger updated. This is the film. |
| 2:20–2:40 | Metrics table. Emphasise 0 false-clears and the conservative-by-design choice. |
| 2:40–3:00 | AO usage during the build. |

Do not narrate architecture. Narrate the workflow.

