## 12. Constraints for whoever is building this

- **No new dependency after 1:00 AM.** Sponsors will keep suggesting tools in
  Discord. One mandatory integration (AO), one inference provider (TensorMux).
  Neatlogs only if it drops in under 20 minutes.
- Prefer boring, working code. No abstraction layers you won't use tonight.
- Every hour, ask: **does this appear in the 3-minute video?** If no, drop it.
- Commit often. Use AO throughout — it's a scored requirement.
